"protection order" means an order made in terms of section 18;
(p)
"residence order" means an order granted in terms of sub-section (1) of section 19;
(q)
"respondent" means any adult male person who is in a domestic relationship with the aggrieved person and against
whom the aggrieved person has sought any relief under this Act:
Provided that an aggrieved wife may also file a complaint against a relative of the husband or the male partner;
(r)
"service provider" means an entity registered under sub-section (1) of section 10;
